        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>三大核心参数解读</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #f5f5f5;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    position: relative;\n    padding-bottom: 40px;\n  }\n  .holes {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 12px 20px 4px 20px;\n  }\n  .hole {\n    width: 18px;\n    height: 18px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 2px solid #cfcfcf;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n  .header-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #222;\n    margin: 18px 0 8px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .header-sub {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #777;\n    margin-bottom: 25px;\n  }\n  .ribbon {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 55px;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 42px;\n    height: 105px;\n    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #ff5b6e 0%, #b13ea3 45%, #2b2b40 100%);\n    border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: flex-start;\n    padding-top: 8px;\n  }\n  .ribbon-text {\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n  }\n  .section {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    padding: 15px 35px 15px 40px;\n    margin-top: 25px;\n  }\n  .icon-box {\n    width: 60px;\n    height: 60px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin-right: 20px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 55px;\n    height: 55px;\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    color: #333;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    background: #fafafa;\n  }\n  .sd-icon svg, .cpu-icon svg {\n    width: 45px;\n    height: 45px;\n  }\n  .content-block {\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .content-title {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #222;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .content-text {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    color: #333;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n  .uhd-box {\n    width: 55px;\n    height: 55px;\n    border: 2px solid #333;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #222;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n  }\n  .uhd-box .big {\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  .uhd-box .small {\n    font-size: 10px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"ribbon\">\n    <span class=\"ribbon-text\">第一步</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"holes\">\n    <div class=\"hole\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hole\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"header-title\">三大核心参数解读</div>\n  <div class=\"header-sub\">内存/芯片/分辨率参数解读</div>\n\n  <!-- Section 1: 内存 -->\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder sd-icon\">[Icon: SD卡]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"content-block\">\n      <div class=\"content-title\">1.看内存</div>\n      <div class=\"content-text\">\n        内存越大速度越快，小于8GB不建议购买。（画圈：<br>\n        GB≠Gb,大GB是小Gb的8倍，尽量选择大GB）\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Section 2: 芯片 -->\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder cpu-icon\">[Icon: CPU芯片]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"content-block\">\n      <div class=\"content-title\">2.看芯片</div>\n      <div class=\"content-text\">\n        主流芯片A73和A53。追求性能玩游戏选A73，看<br>\n        看电视想省电选A53。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Section 3: 分辨率 -->\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n      <div class=\"uhd-box\">\n        <span class=\"big\">4K</span>\n        <span class=\"small\">UHD</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"content-block\">\n      <div class=\"content-title\">3.看分辨率</div>\n      <div class=\"content-text\">\n        分辨率越高越清晰。（目前电视基本都是超高清4K<br>\n        也就是3840×2160的分辨率）\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
